# rk integrate runs this project's pre-integrate suite as
# `prek run --hook-stage manual --all-files`, or as `pre-commit run` with
# the same arguments where prek is not on PATH. Assign to the manual
# stage every check that must pass before work reaches the trunk, and have
# continuous integration invoke the same stages: a check that runs on one
# side of the boundary alone guards one side alone.
